      "descriptionEn": "Pilot subset of Baden-Wuerttemberg course-stage mathematics competencies with a focus on the first shared analysis corridor in basic and advanced course, the adjacent strip of calculation rules and integration procedures, the remaining integral-application strip from the measurement strand, the first stochastics follow-on, the first space-and-shape follow-on, and the first Gaussian-elimination follow-on.",
